        <!-- SECTION 1: 認識 ADHD (Understanding ADHD) -->
        <section id="about-adhd" class="py-16 bg-warmBg">
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
                <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest text-brand-600 uppercase bg-brand-50 px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-100">正向認知</span>
                    <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mt-3">認識 ADHD：用對眼光，看見孩子的獨特價值</h2>
                    <p class="text-slate-600 mt-2">ADHD（注意力不足過動症）是大腦執行功能的發展差異，而非家長教養失敗或孩子故意的行為。</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Interactive Type Switch Tabs -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 shadow-sm border border-slate-200/80 mb-16">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-800 mb-6 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-tags text-amber-500"></i>
                        <span>ADHD 的三大核心類型與表現特質</span>
                    </h3>

                    <!-- Tabs Button -->
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-b border-slate-100 pb-4 mb-6">
                        <button onclick="switchAdhdTab('inattentive')" id="tab-btn-inattentive" class="adhd-tab-btn px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm transition bg-brand-600 text-white shadow-sm">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-eye-slash mr-1.5"></i> 注意力不集中型 (Inattentive)
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="switchAdhdTab('hyperactive')" id="tab-btn-hyperactive" class="adhd-tab-btn px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm transition bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt mr-1.5"></i> 過動 / 衝動型 (Hyperactive)
                        </button>
                        <button onclick="switchAdhdTab('combined')" id="tab-btn-combined" class="adhd-tab-btn px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm transition bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-shuffle mr-1.5"></i> 混合型 (Combined)
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Tab Content Panels -->
                    <div id="tab-content-inattentive" class="adhd-tab-panel grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-center">
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-blue-100 text-blue-800 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold">常見表現：看似發呆、常忘東忘西</div>
                            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">大腦訊息處理較慢，容易被周遭聲音或想法抽離</h4>
                            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-slate-600 text-sm">
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-brand-500 mt-1"></i> 經常漏聽連續指令（例如：「去刷牙、拿書包、穿鞋子」只做第一個）</li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-brand-500 mt-1"></i> 寫作業時間長、容易錯漏字或看錯題目號碼</li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-brand-500 mt-1"></i> 經常遺失文具、水壺或作業本</li>
                            </ul>
                            <div class="p-3 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl text-xs text-amber-900">
                                💡 <strong>陪伴策略：</strong> 給予「一次一個」指令、使用視覺提示卡、將作業拆成短階段。
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100">
                            <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-700 text-sm mb-3">優勢與潛能閃光點：</h5>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
                                <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm"><span class="font-bold text-brand-600 block mb-1">💡 豐富想像力</span>具備獨特觀察视角與藝術創作潛能</div>
                                <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm"><span class="font-bold text-brand-600 block mb-1">🧘 性格溫和</span>不太會正面衝撞，善於沉浸個人興趣</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="tab-content-hyperactive" class="adhd-tab-panel hidden grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-center">
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold">常見表現：坐立難安、精力充沛</div>
                            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">大腦多巴胺抑制機制較弱，需要透過身體動作協助大腦保持清醒</h4>
                            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-slate-600 text-sm">
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-amber-500 mt-1"></i> 坐在椅子上經常扭動、玩手邊的鉛筆或揉紙屑</li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-amber-500 mt-1"></i> 搶著回答問題、難以排隊等待、容易打斷他人說話</li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-amber-500 mt-1"></i> 行為較衝動，少考慮安全或後果</li>
                            </ul>
                            <div class="p-3 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl text-xs text-amber-900">
                                💡 <strong>陪伴策略：</strong> 提供體能宣洩管道（如運動）、給予坐姿彈性（如軟墊）、使用讚賞代替告誡。
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="bg-slate-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100">
                            <h5 class="font-bold text-slate-700 text-sm mb-3">優勢與潛能閃光點：</h5>
                            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs">
                                <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm"><span class="font-bold text-amber-600 block mb-1">⚡ 活力充沛</span>熱情有勁，具備強大的行動力與領導潛質</div>
                                <div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm"><span class="font-bold text-amber-600 block mb-1">🗣️ 真誠直率</span>不隱藏情緒，表達直截了當且熱情</div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="tab-content-combined" class="adhd-tab-panel hidden grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 items-center">
                        <div class="space-y-4">
                            <div class="inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-purple-100 text-purple-800 rounded-lg text-xs font-bold">常見表現：最普遍的診斷類型</div>
                            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-800">同時呈現注意力不集中與過動衝動的特質</h4>
                            <ul class="space-y-2.5 text-slate-600 text-sm">
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-purple-500 mt-1"></i> 容易受到環境刺激分心，同時又很難靜坐</li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-purple-500 mt-1"></i> 在感興趣的事物上展現「過度專注」，但日常課業卻很難提勁</li>
                                <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-purple-500 mt-1"></i> 情緒起伏較快，遇到挫折容易暴走</li>
